<Base title="Privacy Policy | LakeLevelData" description="LakeLevelData does not use cookies or collect personal information.">
  <h1>Privacy policy</h1>
  <p>LakeLevelData is a static website. It does not set cookies, run analytics trackers or collect personal information. Our host, Cloudflare, keeps standard server logs (such as IP address and pages requested) for security and reliability; see Cloudflare's privacy policy.</p>
  <p>If we add advertising or analytics in future, this page will be updated first and will list the providers used.</p>
  <p>Last updated: October 2026.</p>
  <p><strong>Contact form.</strong> If you send us a message, we receive your name, email address and message by email so we can reply. We do not add you to a mailing list or share your details, and we delete messages we no longer need.</p>
</Base>
